\newlabel{tab:composition}{{3}{11}{\textbf {The supervision-composition record.} Eight recipes, one architecture; each row adds one labeled pool (cumulative). ``Early'' latencies are negative: the model fires seconds before the turn ends. Every fix moved the model \emph {along} the apparent frontier, never off it --- until the labels themselves changed.\relax }{table.caption.15}{}}
