\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Dictation and spelled-entity probes.} Premature end-of-turn fires per dictated 10-digit number, final-boundary recall (window $+1.75$\,s), digit accuracy; exact-match on spelled names/emails without/with the user-profile context; and the wrong-profile intrusion rate. Adding dictation schemas beats every timeout on premature fires but, trained on matching profiles only, copies a wrong profile 11.3\% of the time; distractor-ratio training (context and audio disagree, target follows audio) removes that at no cost --- one unified model. Residual dictation misses are $\sim $5 fires landing $\sim $2\,s after speech end, just outside the window.\relax }}{16}{table.caption.35}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:dictation}{{7}{16}{\textbf {Dictation and spelled-entity probes.} Premature end-of-turn fires per dictated 10-digit number, final-boundary recall (window $+1.75$\,s), digit accuracy; exact-match on spelled names/emails without/with the user-profile context; and the wrong-profile intrusion rate. Adding dictation schemas beats every timeout on premature fires but, trained on matching profiles only, copies a wrong profile 11.3\% of the time; distractor-ratio training (context and audio disagree, target follows audio) removes that at no cost --- one unified model. Residual dictation misses are $\sim $5 fires landing $\sim $2\,s after speech end, just outside the window.\relax }{table.caption.35}{}}
